@*The zone is the first child of the header links <ul> (HeaderLinks/Default.cshtml :7), so this emits an
  <li> and nothing around it. `ico-` prefixed classes are how every other item in that list is styled, and a
  theme restyling its header links picks this up with them rather than needing to know about us.*@

<li><a href="@Url.RouteUrl(CWCoreDefaults.BULKORDER_INDEX)" class="ico-bulk-order">@T("Plugins.CW.Core.BulkOrder.HeaderLink")</a></li>